    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "AnTonia G (SweetMadameBlue)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114080774820996452461/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcO3gNjBMiYXu4tKkIlrxb70qU_l_v66VdKO629F6-VkgjKRSw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Matthew took care of me. He redeemed my faith in BELL stores. I had previously gone to the one in Dorion and got screwed each time. MATTHEW was patient, knowledgeable and got me the best phone and best price. I was very, very, very happy.",
        "time": 1767146200,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stewart G.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118436127742807880582/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW9YOhED6Dn4lp2Vuu8Suy5-j9dslKIyg-e6EssWug5_wTt_iM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Did a full switch from Videotron to Bell yesterday, 4 cell lines and home internet service. Wilfrid gave very competitive prices  and excellent, proactive service. Took a bit of time, but it's so much better than spending all afternoon on the phone!",
        "time": 1763227365,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brandon Katz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110957757449976628358/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDPoTCVchUeicfCO1C-6KwYLVSeUQt978kJ6w3nUtsQxSrHSNC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I had a great experience whilst shopping for a new mobile phone. Morsale was extremely competent and went above and beyond to make me feel like a valued client. She was attentive, knowledgeable and went to every possible length to get me the best deal on my purchase. I would be more than happy to return to this outlet for future mobile needs.\n\nMany thanks",
        "time": 1754020217,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cara-Jade Kegle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107413284815591310406/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWz4bh4CWfFCZYLbheM0ZyR7ZampVOjzuuNB0EEI5Vv7RUzIdSYYg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I hate bell , everything about it, the magic extra bill amounts they add to your bills, and shitty phone customer service, only reason im giving 5 stars this time is for lovely Morsale from this particular bell, she took the time to call the billing department and tell them we showed proof all payments were made and why they tried to charge 2 extra bills for non payment when its pre-authorized.... she took her time with us and was very patient and understanding! This woman deserves a big fat raise!!",
        "time": 1760432828,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Red Pilled",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101219982428556109688/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2TvrY8ES2R_-2l6ogzPIZJBkp-qZf_QTJj4Cs4NyPakn2GJ0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Ralph is the man, we went to videotron next door and had the worst experience. When we went to Bell, it was like night and day. Great customer service on his part, good job Bell",
